00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.860
Huh?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.580
Ooyama Takeru!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.040
Haru-nee.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.880
Himegami-senpai.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.080
What are you doing here?!

